+def test_deferred_lookup_keeps_arrival_order():
+    """(local 2026-10-22) A request whose connector lookup was deferred keeps its
+    place in `waiting`. It used to join `skipped_waiting`, which FCFS serves
+    first, so it went ahead of an older request preempted meanwhile: here the
+    newer request took the free blocks and the older one did not fit."""
